Bundled SVG icons
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MaatLog inlines a small set of SVG icons in its Jinja templates
(src/maatlog/themes/maatlog-base/maatlog/components/author-links.html) so that
generated sites need no external icon library and no CDN request.

Brand icons
-----------

The following icons are derived from Simple Icons v16.29.0:

  github    GitHub
  x         X
  bluesky   Bluesky
  rss       RSS (the standard feed icon)

