LinkedIn
--------

MaatLog ships no LinkedIn logo. Simple Icons removed the LinkedIn icon from its
set, so a bundled LinkedIn mark could not rest on the same CC0 basis as the
icons above. A link whose type is "linkedin" is rendered with MaatLog's own
generic link icon plus the text label "LinkedIn".

Generic icons
-------------

